{'symbol': 'AMT', 'date': '2023-03-08 16:15:00', 'title': 'AMERICAN TOWER CORPORATION ANNOUNCES PRICING OF SECURITIES OFFERING', 'text': 'BOSTON--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AMERICAN TOWER CORPORATION (NYSE: AMT) (THE “COMPANY”) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT CERTAIN OF ITS INDIRECT SUBSIDIARIES PRICED, IN A PRIVATE TRANSACTION, $1.3 BILLION AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF SECURED TOWER REVENUE SECURITIES, SERIES 2023-1, SUBCLASS A (THE “SERIES 2023-1A SECURITIES”). UPON ISSUANCE, THE SERIES 2023-1A SECURITIES WILL HAVE A PRINCIPAL BALANCE OF $1.3 BILLION, AN INTEREST RATE OF 5.'}